35,2,1,talk,Sakura,,"I found that separate rooms cost nearly 8,000 yen more for some people last time.","{""words"":15,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
36,2,1,talk,Victoria,,"I saw that offshore houses are about 5,400 yen a head a night, with food on top.","{""words"":17,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
37,2,1,talk,Midori,,"Last year, two of us didn't meet from breakfast to dinner. That felt wrong.","{""words"":14,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
38,2,1,talk,Toshio,,The ferry takes two days total. The train to the spa is only ninety minutes.,"{""words"":15,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
39,2,1,talk,Daisuke,,"The island houses have one bathroom for everyone, and the water runs cold.","{""words"":13,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
40,2,2,talk,Sakura,,"@Victoria So the island is cheaper per head, but we still pay for food separately?","{""words"":15,""mentions"":[""Victoria""],""raw_differs"":false}"
41,2,2,talk,Victoria,,@Sakura Yes. But the all-in rate charges the light eater the same as the big eater.,"{""words"":16,""mentions"":[""Sakura""],""raw_differs"":false}"
42,2,2,talk,Midori,,@Toshio Ninety minutes is much better than two days. I prefer the train option.,"{""words"":14,""mentions"":[""Toshio""],""raw_differs"":false}"
43,2,2,talk,Toshio,,"@Midori The city has trains every few minutes, so we don't have to plan ahead.","{""words"":15,""mentions"":[""Midori""],""raw_differs"":false}"
44,2,2,talk,Daisuke,,"@Midori The inn has fixed mealtimes. Dinner at six, breakfast at half seven.","{""words"":13,""mentions"":[""Midori""],""raw_differs"":false}"
45,2,3,talk,Sakura,,I like that the city lets us arrange our own routes. It feels fairer.,"{""words"":14,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
46,2,3,talk,Victoria,,I am concerned about the hidden costs in the city if we buy meals separately.,"{""words"":15,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
47,2,3,talk,Midori,,The shared house year meant no time alone. The town with streets absorbs that better.,"{""words"":15,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
48,2,3,talk,Toshio,,The bus in the spa valley stops before seven. That might be restrictive.,"{""words"":13,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
49,2,3,talk,Daisuke,,The city room has a door and no timetable. That sounds much better for me.,"{""words"":15,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
50,2,4,talk,Sakura,,I think the city break might be the best balance for everyone.,"{""words"":12,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
51,2,4,talk,Victoria,,"I need to be sure the total cost is predictable. The city bed is 12,000 to 20,000.","{""words"":17,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
52,2,4,talk,Midori,,I agree. The hot spring town feels too rigid with the fixed mealtimes.,"{""words"":13,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
53,2,4,talk,Toshio,,The city is efficient. We can move without waiting for a bus or ferry.,"{""words"":14,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
54,2,4,talk,Daisuke,,I am relieved to hear the city has private rooms. I can sleep better there.,"{""words"":15,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
