60,3,1,talk,Sakura,,"So we have three options: Island, City, or Hot Spring Town.","{""words"":11,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
61,3,1,talk,Victoria,,"I am leaning towards the City, but I want to confirm the cost structure.","{""words"":14,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
62,3,1,talk,Midori,,I think the City Break allows for the best mix of togetherness and alone time.,"{""words"":15,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
63,3,1,talk,Toshio,,The City is the most efficient. We lose the least time to travel.,"{""words"":13,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
64,3,1,talk,Daisuke,,I am very happy with the City option. The private room is essential for me.,"{""words"":15,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
65,3,2,talk,Sakura,,"@Victoria The city bed cost varies, but we can split the bill evenly if we book together.","{""words"":17,""mentions"":[""Victoria""],""raw_differs"":false}"
66,3,2,talk,Victoria,,@Sakura That works. I can accept the range if we agree on a budget cap.,"{""words"":15,""mentions"":[""Sakura""],""raw_differs"":false}"
67,3,2,talk,Midori,,I am glad we are all on the same page about the City.,"{""words"":13,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
68,3,2,talk,Toshio,,I agree. Let's not overthink the minor details. The City is the clear winner.,"{""words"":14,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
69,3,2,talk,Daisuke,,"I am a bit shy, but I really want to go to the City.","{""words"":14,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
70,3,3,talk,Sakura,,I will vote for the City Break. It feels the most fair and flexible.,"{""words"":14,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
71,3,3,talk,Victoria,,I will also vote for the City Break. The predictability is manageable.,"{""words"":12,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
72,3,3,talk,Midori,,I vote for the City Break. It respects our need for both connection and space.,"{""words"":15,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
73,3,3,talk,Toshio,,I vote for the City Break. It is the most logical choice.,"{""words"":12,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
74,3,3,talk,Daisuke,,I vote for the City Break. Thank you for understanding my needs.,"{""words"":12,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
75,3,4,talk,Sakura,,It looks like we are all voting for the City.,"{""words"":10,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
76,3,4,talk,Victoria,,"Yes, it seems unanimous. I am satisfied with this decision.","{""words"":10,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
77,3,4,talk,Midori,,I am happy we found a place that works for everyone.,"{""words"":11,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
78,3,4,talk,Toshio,,Good. We can start planning the routes now.,"{""words"":8,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
79,3,4,talk,Daisuke,,I am excited. I think I will sleep well this time.,"{""words"":11,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
